essionID\":\"ses_33ab7ce6cffeKY4KUUDy0n9FCY\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_cc5484efa001jTCFsSTA9FTx0L\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_33ab7ce6cffeKY4KUUDy0n9FCY\",\"messageID\":\"msg_cc548326c001UhNohFWcXGzNyv\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"reason\":\"tool-calls\",\"snapshot\":\"f69862e7acb524300f690aa2fd2b4a308a916687\",\"cost\":0.00043641,\"tokens\":{\"total\":11784,\"input\":21,\"output\":66,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"read\":11697,\"write\":0}}}}\n12: {\"type\":\"step_start\",\"timestamp\":1772836378369,\"sessionID\":\"ses_33ab7ce6cffeKY4KUUDy0n9FCY\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_cc54856ff001LshZw3ddzcvw77\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_33ab7ce6cffeKY4KUUDy0n9FCY\",\"messageID\":\"msg_cc5484f0e00124q86YnXKrdvMr\",\"type\":\"step-start\",\"snapshot\":\"2892990e33101e1f704168b3f11f673aab278fec\"}}\n13: {\"type\":\"text\",\"timestamp\":1772836387549,\"sessionID\":\"ses_33ab7ce6cffeKY4KUUDy0n9FCY\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_cc5485d5c0019iQc6cXas6DzXb\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_33ab7ce6cffeKY4KUUDy0n9FCY\",\"messageID\":\"msg_cc5484f0e00124q86YnXKrdvMr\",\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [],\\n  \\\"plan\\\": \\\"## Plan: Add Code Path to Board Configuration\\\\n\\\\n### Overview\\\\nAdd code path and context file support to each board's configuration so AI agents know where project code lives and have access to project-level context.\\\\n\\\\n### Implementation Steps\\\\n\\\\n1. **Update Config Schema**\\\\n   - Modify `~/.mad/config.json` schema to include a new `code_path` field\\\\n   - This field should point to the project root directory\\\\n   - Validate the path exists and is accessible\\\\n\\\\n2. **Create CONTEXT.md Support**\\\\n   - Add support for reading/writing `~/.mad/CONTEXT.md` file\\\\n   - This file will contain free-form project context\\\\n   - Provide CLI commands to edit/view the context file\\\\n\\\\n3. **Modify Agent Invocation**\\\\n   - Update agent startup to set working directory to project root (from `code_path`)\\\\n   - Prepend agent instructions with:\\\\n     - Code path information\\\\n     - Path to CONTEXT.md file\\\\n   - Ensure this happens on every agent invocation\\\\n\\\\n4. **Board Configuration Updates**\\\\n   - Each board should automatically derive or reference its project root\\\\n   - Board config should store/link to the `code_path`\\\\n   - When a board is invoked, read its associated `code_path` and `CONTEXT.md`\\\\n\\\\n5. **CLI Commands**\\\\n   - Add `mad config set-code-path <path>` to set the code path\\\\n   - Add `mad context edit` to edit CONTEXT.md\\\\n   - Add `mad context show` to display CONTEXT.md\\\\n\\\\n6. **Backward Compatibility**\\\\n   - If `code_path` is not set, derive from board location (current behavior)\\\\n   - If `CONTEXT.md` doesn't exist, provide empty context\\\\n\\\\n### Files to Modify\\\\n- Config handling code (likely in `src/config/` or similar)\\\\n- Agent invocation/launcher code\\\\n- CL... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\n14: {\"type\":\"step_finish\",\"timestamp\":1772836387560,\"sessionID\":\"ses_33ab7ce6cffeKY4KUUDy0n9FCY\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_cc5487add001hBpLTzQyMM3tDN\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_33ab7ce6cffeKY4KUUDy0n9FCY\",\"messageID\":\"msg_cc5484f0e00124q86YnXKrdvMr\",\"type\":\"step-finish\",\"reason\":\"stop\",\"snapshot\":\"241a183a4631f80a1e89ae1ebb8e4f89a4f4f85b\",\"cost\":0.00124263,\"tokens\":{\"total\":12960,\"input\":584,\"output\":595,\"reasoning\":0,\"cache\":{\"read\":11781,\"write\":0}}}}\n15: \n16: \n17: \n18: ---\n19: \n20: ## Your Task\n21: \n22: Review the plan and provide feedback. Consider:\n23: \n24: 1. **Completeness**: Does the plan cover all necessary aspects of the feature?\n25: 2. **Clarity**: Is the plan clear and unambiguous?\n26: 3. **Feasibility**: Are there any technical concerns or blockers?\n27: 4. **Edge cases**: What happens with edge cases or error conditions?\n28: 5. **Dependencies**: Are all dependencies identified?\n29: \n30: If previous feedback was provided, verify that the plan addresses those concerns.\n31: \n